# Deep links like /stop/1234 or /route/80 have no file behind them on a static
# host, so the SPA shell must answer for them. 200 (rewrite) rather than
# 301/302: the URL stays /stop/1234 in the address bar and remains
# bookmarkable/shareable, which is the whole point of having real paths
# instead of #hash routing.
#
# Data and assets are listed first so they are never swallowed by the catch-all.
/data/*    /data/:splat   200
/app.js    /app.js        200
/stop/*    /index.html    200
/route/*   /index.html    200
/about     /index.html    200
